flowchart TD
  A[sync SOURCE TARGET?] --> B{TARGET given?}
  B -- no --> P[TargetPicker: list /media, /run/media, /mnt] --> C
  B -- yes --> C{rsync installed?}
  C -- no --> X[error]
  C -- yes --> D{source and target nested?}
  D -- yes --> X
  D -- no --> E{fs type exFAT/FAT/NTFS?}
  E -- yes --> X
  E -- no --> H{hard-link test ok?}
  H -- no --> X
  H -- yes --> R[rsync --dry-run -i: summary]
  R --> Q{changes and confirmed?}
  Q -- no --> REP
  Q -- yes --> T[rsync -aHu --no-inc-recursive] --> REP[TargetReport: target-only files]
